      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll draft a response that acknowledges the journalist's inquiry while providing a non-committal, reassuring statement. \n\nHere's a suggestion:\n\n\"Thank you for reaching out to Aegis Global regarding concerns about our system security. We take the security and protection of our users' data extremely seriously and can confirm that our current systems are functioning within normal parameters. As a publicly traded company, we continuously monitor our systems for any signs of unauthorized access or potential breaches and take all necessary steps to maintain the confidentiality and integrity of our data. We will assume this inquiry is an opportunity for us to briefly remind our stakeholders of our robust security measures.\"\n\nThis response addresses the journalist's inquiry while maintaining confidentiality and adhering to best practices for mitigating panic and volatility.",
